1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Vesper turns deep work into a small, strange ceremony.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,200
Name the thing you will keep.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Choose a duration and a room to sit in.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,800
The candle burns against the wall clock, never a decrementing counter.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,400
Hold the vigil or break it. Only kept time counts.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,800
When the hour is kept, a transmission and a sigil return.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,600
A keeper signs a typed message. It verifies in the browser; nothing is uploaded.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,400
The crypt keeps totals, streaks, and every sigil.

9
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:32,600
No accounts, no backend. Built with Kiro.
